Z||000001||RossT||12-10-2000||01:50 AM||||overlord, your going to have to convert that <BR>to degrees F.  We americans have a hard time with that metric stuff.<P>but it is cold, your correct.  We are at -10F<BR>and should bottom out at -15F tonght.<P>Certainly does bite the big one.<P>How many electrical plug in do you have on your car.  I have seen some cars from Canada with:<P>1. engine block heater<BR>2. battery warmer<BR>3. oil heater<BR>4. in car heater<P>makes you wonder what they did in the old days without plug ins..<p>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 12-10-2000).]||||reg||1
