Z||000004||mrfiero||12-10-2000||02:48 AM||||All of that cold Canadian air is blowing down here.  Our high Saturady was almost 60*, but we'll be lucky to see 30* on Sunday.  It gets worse for us too.....lows in the -10* range and highs in the single digits-low teens all next week.<P>Kind of stinks, but I guess we can't complain......it's the first real cold snap of the year.<P>||||reg||1
